Hello all,

Ipex and presumably all Canadian IPS pressure pipe have thicker walls in th=
e bells of the pipe.  This means that the bell OD is larger than US IPS pre=
ssure pipe.  We have had a project confirming that our 3" bell ring used in=
 the Style B restraint did not fit around the bell of Ipex pipe.  It can be=
 presumed that the other sizes of Style B restraint may have this issue on =
Ipex/Canadian IPS pipe.

If a customer is using Ipex or and Canadian IPS pipe the Style A Pipe to Pi=
pe restraint should be used.

--_000_4414AEBBCFB2B648B49E5766D309768E811C7DAB0DMAIL_
